{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115163853898-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115172923\"/><p>婦人頭部被石屎擊中浴血。（陳嘉順攝）</p><p>深水埗有石屎剝落。今午(15日)4時26分，鴨寮街1-7號有一塊如手掌般的大石屎剝落，並擊中一名途經現場的65歲婦人頭部，街坊見狀報案。救護員接報抵達，為婦人包紮傷口，再將其送往醫院治療。警員經調查後，檢走墮下的石屎作進一步調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:38:50.376773+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T08:38:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T09:32:28.214556+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:32:28.214556+00:00","content_hash":"9667f72c35478c7668924a523d0d5c63decb85eca3ecd065367c85fbb1bf6f9e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}